  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "quickFacts",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=156",
      "html": "<p>Easily distinguished by its large head, short barbels, and translucent yellowish body. Maximum size 5 cm SL. Type locality: Brahmaputra River, India.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=156",
      "html": "<p>Asia: Brahmaputra River basin in India. Indian waters, North Eastern India, Padma, Ganges.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "waterConditions",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=156",
      "html": "<p>pH 6.0–7.0. Temperature 20–25°C. Current, if provided, should not be too strong.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "equipment",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=156",
      "html": "<p>Provide ample driftwood and vegetation, as this species likes to hide in the shade.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "diet",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=156",
      "html": "<p>Shows a marked preference for live or frozen food.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "behaviour",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=156",
      "html": "<p>Peaceful, somewhat delicate fish that should be kept in small groups of 3-4 individuals. Tankmates should not be too boisterous, and may include Colisa and smaller Rasbora species.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "dimorphism",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=156",
      "html": "<p>Males are more slender and have an elongate genital papilla in front of the anus.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "reproduction",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=156",
      "html": "<p>Not reported. There is no breeding report.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "references",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
